2026-07-27T08:22:18.9556281Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9557052Z i /tmp/Rtmpe2A7Pu/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9557534Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9558098Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9559042Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9559899Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9561140Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9561966Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9847797Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:18.9968132Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:19.0448961Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:19.0634588Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
